{"id":"d_main_33_01","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch33","label":"Chapter 33 · Clash"},"label":"Destroy the Crystal Region","stage":"33-5 STAGE · Start","prev":null,"next":"d_main_33_02_s","speakers":{"shifty_c":"Shifty","anis":"Anis","shifty_r":"Shifty","cinderella":"Cinderella","rapi":"Rapi","neon":"Neon","grave_no":"Grave","mana_op":"Mana"},"icons":{"shifty_c":"si_c907_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s","shifty_r":"si_c907_00_s","cinderella":"si_c511_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s","grave_no":"si_c510_00_s","mana_op":"si_c290_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_33_01_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_1","text":"Reclamation Site 01.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CountryVillage_d","bgArt":"countryvillage_d","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_beforethenextstep","movie":null,"shown":["cinderella","rapi","anis","neon"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_2","text":"According to the Central Government,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["shifty_c"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_3","text":"the eradication of Crystal Region is proceeding as planned, but it is not a high priority.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_4","text":"This operation is to prioritize the extermination or capture of Heretics above all else.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_5","text":"In short, that's the case.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_6","text":"I figured that's how they'd feel.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_7","text":"They want us to take out Behemoth.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_8","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_8","text":"Anis glances at Cinderella.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_9","text":"I don't think that will be a problem.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_10","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_10","text":"Did they not say anything about Cinderella?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_11","text":"That's currently considered top-secret information.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["shifty_r"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_12","text":"Uh... What with all the recent incidents, if it were to come to light that we had joined forces with a Heretic, the Ark would be in an uproar.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_13","text":"I, as well as Mana, are doing our utmost to keep this under wraps.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_14","text":"Even within the Central Government itself, only a select few are aware of Cinderella.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_15","text":"Proceed with the assumption that only Deputy Chief Andersen knows.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_16","text":"How about Deputy Chief Burningum?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_17","text":"We're taking special care to ensure he remains in the dark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_18","text":"If he were to find out about this, he would send troops over here in an instant.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_19","text":"Okay. Thanks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_20","text":"Right. If people in the Ark found out Cinderella's awakened, it'd be pandemonium.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_21","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_21","text":"Anis glances at Cinderella again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_22","text":"Why do you keep sneaking glances at me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_23","text":"Huh? N-nothing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_24","text":"If you're going to eyeball me, at least get a decent look. My beauty should be appreciated properly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_25","text":"... I'm not sure if she and I are going to get along.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_26","text":"If all we have to do is take down Behemoth, we'll be fine.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_27","text":"If I were on my own, I'd be more hesitant,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_28","text":"but together with Grave and you guys, it's very much possible.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_29","text":"As long as my Prince is with me, I can't imagine a scenario where we don't emerge victorious.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_30","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_30","text":"Cinderella smiles at me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_31","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_32","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_33","text":"However, there's no guarantee Behemoth is the only Heretic we'll be facing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_34","text":"Four Beasts. As their name implies, there's bound to be four of them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_35","text":"Worst comes to worst, we might find ourselves up against four Heretics at once.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_36","text":"However, if four Heretics were to engage us in battle,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_37","text":"that would mean four warriors of my caliber would be needed to rise up and fight them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_38","text":"It's a bit overwhelming!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_39","text":"Can you imagine the sheer loveliness of four of me? So distracted would we be by such rapturous beauty, it would almost certainly affect our chances of winning!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_40","text":"Okay, now I'm seriously doubting my ability to get along with this lady.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_41","text":"She's right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_42","text":"That's why a pre-emptive strike is our best course of action.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_43","text":"Yeah, especially since we're on Behemoth's home turf.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_44","text":"The fact she can command the crystals makes her formidable on her own.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_45","text":"If she calls in for reinforcements on top of that, then we'll have a real problem on our hands.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_46","text":"So we should hit 'em fast and hit 'em hard, before they have time to prepare.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_47","text":"We may not have Absolute, but we do have an ancient Heretic on our side.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_48","text":"The odds are in our favor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_49","text":"Excuse me, but I object to the term \"ancient\".","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_50","text":"Oh. Sorry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_51","text":"It makes me sound old. I prefer the word \"legendary\".","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_52","text":"Okay, now I'm sure of it. You and I are definitely not going to get along.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_53","text":"We'll move out as soon as we're finished preparing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_54","text":"Is that okay with you, Commander?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_55","text":"His name is Prince.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_56","text":"No. I call him Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_57","text":"So confrontational, Rapi! That's not like you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_58","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_58","text":"Personally, I wouldn't object to moving out right now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_59","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_59","text":"However, if we're going to go through with this, it would be a good idea to prepare a bit more.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_60","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_60","text":"What's the latest on Absolute and Grave?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_61","text":"Absolute will rejoin us after maintenance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_62","text":"Wow. If they're jumping back into the mix that quickly, they must be really peeved.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_63","text":"There's more to it than that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_64","text":"I think they're trying to tell me something.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_65","text":"They're not going to wait for me anymore.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_66","text":"??","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_67","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_68","text":"Grave also said she'd be rejoining us after her repairs.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_69","text":"She definitely looked like she needed a tune-up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_70","text":"Apparently she's a mass-produced model?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_71","text":"Impressive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_72","text":"It's more than impressive, it's...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_01_73","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_01_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_M